ar guy at school. A perfectionist with a cool attitude, he has blond hair at medium length and normally stands at the front of the No.5 best of the school. It is said that because of his handsome attire many people come attracted to him but not many people can approach him also because of his cool attitude. During the character's diet training he visits her from time to time, but says only a few words of encouragement."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5385"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6a/6ab1c23691ded83323662491c3808e3613776d5ecf3422a21e3656f189438252.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2b/2ba4fa85cd88e12a759117f44fedbebb35f6b8ab46fc64e30279845d16570d96.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"櫻井 孝宏","creatorId":"vndb:s50","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s50","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s50","name":"櫻井 孝宏","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:24127","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c5386","characterName":"華原 雅紀","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c5386"},"originalCharacterName":"華原 雅紀","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"117"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"181"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ranked second most popular. Easy to talk to and loves sports. He loves his dog, whom you can normally find going on a walk with."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"He had a friend who had once betrayed him and he could not trust anyone again, that's why most of the time, his smiles and laughs are fake."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5386"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e0/e07e82cd04c816ae63b609f7decf07471c45cafae0146cb7253905b47834ece1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e4/e480e767c02ea8c28eb552a58de0ea14ee26f24e063f55f8a381e4b3d9948a7a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"三宅 淳一","creatorId":"vndb:s640","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s640","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s640","name":"三宅 淳一","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:24136","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c5387","characterName":"深水 颯大","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c5387"},"originalCharacterName":"深水 颯大","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"417"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"163"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Souta is a year younger than the protagonist, he is one of the only guys that treat you nicely in the beginning of the game. He loves sweets and often invites the character to have some with him at night. He participates in the festival play with the player as the main character and he becomes rather fond of the character, even if she does not show affection to him, often saying things like \"If you don't like something about me, tell me, 'cause I'll change it\". You can meet him at the sports center on random days."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5387"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f5/f59b5587ec64cf87231673cb521332a6893ba283c2b73569b832e53bd351602c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a0/a0a18e5966c073f30c6ce7459899d5f545660068df12ae8e84f5549aae5adcd7.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"菅沼 久義","creatorId":"vndb:s375","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s375","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s375","name":"菅沼 久義","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:24133","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c5388","characterName":"橘 剣之助","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c5388"},"originalCharacterName":"橘 剣之助","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"630"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"179"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Fourth most popular guy. He is an heir to a Yakuza gang but he has a very different dream from being a Yakuza leader in mind. He is known as the cool, or mature guy of the school (a bit like Ichinose). He talks politely and the character can find him at the goods store after a while. He loves basketball although he claims to have no hobby. Although his attire may seem cold he's really very shy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5388"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8b/8b37f52835c148d5bbef2912640dd3c5830