,"source":"vndb","value":"186"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The school's doctor. Wakatsuki-sensei is rather like a student than a doctor. He loves alcohol, cigars and beer. He likes to tease the character and sometimes views her as \"impossible\" but he helps her anyway. He is also a bachelor although he can't walk the character home as often as the others. He is always seen with a pony tail and head phones."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5392"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/59/5907e8d2ec2c61afa5fa2a0f737cf4f847d7243cee2713e6b787d2329adcadbb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/95/957dcbe669456b260141d95aae35108bc0a8aaef3e3f417a5cdc8d5bcdb60534.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"杉田 智和","creatorId":"vndb:s370","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s370","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s370","name":"杉田 智和","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:24132","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c5393","characterName":"桜川 鷹士","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c5393"},"originalCharacterName":"桜川 鷹士","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"809"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"187"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The main character's brother. He supports the main character through her diet and also makes monthly charts that show how \"in love\" the various candidates are with her. He is quite hot-headed, gets jealous easily, very protective and has an obvious sister complex. He also gives you a monthly allowance of 5000 yen."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5393"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/83/83747f9e16e605a73ce155f8d0f356af6404a6cfb09003c2b38251c6f591a382.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cd/cdbbafa16491d937e7715948254bab807b2dd45dcf2fa4cf158c94c7ba19baf9.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"平川 大輔","creatorId":"vndb:s133","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s133","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s133","name":"平川 大輔","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:24130","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c5394","characterName":"桜川 ヒトミ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c5394"},"originalCharacterName":"桜川 ヒトミ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"100"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hitomi was once a cute, beautiful girl, winning beauty contests in childhood. However, after losing to the temptation of junk food received from fans, she steadily gained weight... until she reached 100 kg in her second year of high school. At the beginning of the school year, she and her brother move into her father's mansion-like dorm. Surprise awaits as she discovers that the school's most popular guys are also moving in. Their impressions on her shock her into starting a diet."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5394"}],"p